1
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:51,940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

2
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:54,980
[Episode 22]
[This story is purely fictional]

3
00:01:54,980 --> 00:02:02,700
[Equality for Everyone, Justice in Administration]

4
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:09,740
[Equality for Everyone, Justice in Administration]

5
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,570
Laogou.

6
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,780
You asked me to bring you here.

7
00:02:16,630 --> 00:02:17,780
Did you recall something?

8
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:40,450
You fired a gun here.

9
00:02:44,710 --> 00:02:45,450
Laogou.

10
00:02:45,750 --> 00:02:47,220
It's a complicated story.

11
00:02:47,590 --> 00:02:48,660
Did you

12
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:49,980
fire a gun here or not?

13
00:02:57,310 --> 00:02:58,290
Take your gun out.

14
00:02:58,910 --> 00:02:59,850
And shoot once more.

15
00:03:04,430 --> 00:03:05,010
What?

16
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,820
Afraid that my memories will come back?

17
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,010
Open fire.

18
00:03:30,150 --> 00:03:30,820
Again.

19
00:03:38,750 --> 00:03:40,010
Zhang Qishan!

20
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,340
Again.

21
00:03:48,310 --> 00:03:49,010
Again!

22
00:03:50,460 --> 00:03:52,690
Again. Again!

23
00:04:01,150 --> 00:04:01,940
Colonel Hatoyama.

24
00:04:05,430 --> 00:04:06,290
Colonel Hatoyama.

25
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:08,380
How much longer do we need?

26
00:04:09,590 --> 00:04:10,890
Qingwuzi said

27
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,850
the gate was here.

28
00:04:14,750 --> 00:04:16,780
We need to operate the mechanism six times

29
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:17,730
to open it.

30
00:04:18,070 --> 00:04:19,700
Operate it six times.

31
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,290
How many times has it been now?

32
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:22,660
The sixth, sir.

33
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:23,700
The mechanism.

34
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,050
The mechanism is unlocked.

35
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:28,900
Qingwuzi is right.

36
00:04:39,430 --> 00:04:40,310
Let's go.

37
00:04:41,190 --> 00:04:41,660
Yes.

38
00:04:53,510 --> 00:04:54,220
Spare him.

39
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,290
- No. - Master.

40
00:04:58,390 --> 00:04:59,050
No!

41
00:05:00,750 --> 00:05:01,340
No!

42
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:02,850
No!

43
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:03,660
No!

44
00:05:03,870 --> 00:05:04,540
No!

45
00:05:05,190 --> 00:05:05,810
Laogou.

46
00:05:05,870 --> 00:05:06,460
Master!

47
00:05:10,070 --> 00:05:10,660
No.

48
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:22,140
No.

49
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,050
What is going on?

50
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:31,250
Did you recall something?

51
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:32,610
Yes.

52
00:05:33,510 --> 00:05:34,370
I feel

53
00:05:35,870 --> 00:05:36,930
brokenhearted.

54
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:38,490
I am upset.

55
00:05:40,870 --> 00:05:41,980
I also saw the Japanese.

56
00:05:44,950 --> 00:05:46,220
But I couldn't recall

57
00:05:46,950 --> 00:05:48,250
what exactly happened.

58
00:05:58,240 --> 00:05:59,340
Can you let me try it?

59
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:08,170
Laogou.

60
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:09,580
What are you doing?

61
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:10,410
Freeze.

62
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:11,460
Put down the gun.

63
00:06:13,190 --> 00:06:14,370
What in the world?

64
00:06:14,750 --> 00:06:15,810
Did you

65
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,020
kill my man here?

66
00:06:18,830 --> 00:06:20,220
I knelt and begged you,

67
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:21,980
but you didn't spare him.

68
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:24,140
Yes.

69
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,050
Why?

70
00:06:25,310 --> 00:06:26,370
Because he violated the law.

71
00:06:28,510 --> 00:06:29,050
Laogou.

72
00:06:29,310 --> 00:06:29,700
It's

73
00:06:29,950 --> 00:06:31,460
not what you think it is.

74
00:06:31,750 --> 00:06:32,700
Put down the gun.

75
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:33,810
Master Zhang

76
00:06:33,830 --> 00:06:34,610
can explain everything.

77
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:37,220
Don't just stand there.

78
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,580
Talk to your master now.

79
00:06:39,390 --> 00:06:40,020
Master.

80
00:06:40,510 --> 00:06:42,170
It's not what you think it is.

81
00:06:42,270 --> 00:06:42,850
Don't...

82
00:06:42,870 --> 00:06:43,660
Shut up!

83
00:06:45,190 --> 00:06:46,610
I can't even remember myself.

84
00:06:47,630 --> 00:06:48,410
I can't tell

85
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:50,660
if you're lying to me or not.

86
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,020
You can lie to one

87
00:06:58,630 --> 00:06:59,580
or two people.

88
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:02,020
But you can't lie to everyone in the city.

89
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:03,730
I want to find out

90
00:07:04,870 --> 00:07:06,410
what kind of person

91
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,610
stays by my side every day.

92
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:14,220
I want them to tell me

93
00:07:15,750 --> 00:07:17,490
if you have hurt the people,

94
00:07:18,070 --> 00:07:19,220
if you have betrayed your friends,

95
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:20,370
or if you

96
00:07:20,390 --> 00:07:21,660
have any secret dealings.

97
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,730
No, Fifth Master.

98
00:07:23,870 --> 00:07:25,850
Master Zhang isn't someone like that.

99
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:27,540
He's a righteous officer.

100
00:07:27,630 --> 00:07:28,700
Yes, Fifth Master.

101
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:30,660
You are kind to us,

102
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,140
but Master Zhang

103
00:07:32,390 --> 00:07:34,410
is also our benefactor.

104
00:07:34,870 --> 00:07:35,340
That's right.

105
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,900
- After Master Zhang came to Changsha, - I agree.

106
00:07:37,070 --> 00:07:38,540
our lives took a turn

107
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:40,250
for the better.

108
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,580
Right, everyone?

109
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:43,900
- Yes. - Yes.

110
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,810
I can tell you

111
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:23,900
what happened back then.

112
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:27,540
No need.

113
00:08:30,870 --> 00:08:31,810
I just wanted to make sure

114
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:35,010
that you didn't kill the innocent.

115
00:09:17,790 --> 00:09:18,610
The Japanese

116
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,770
brought me to this place.

117
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:22,770
It's a stage.

118
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:25,010
There were three people in opera costumes.

119
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:26,490
The child in the middle

120
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,580
was kneeling at the center.

121
00:09:31,150 --> 00:09:32,250
Great, Fifth Master.

122
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,770
You recalled something.

123
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,460
What you drew

124
00:09:35,910 --> 00:09:37,250
is Madam Wang's Lecture.

125
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:40,130
What is Madam Wang's Lecture?

126
00:09:40,510 --> 00:09:41,730
It's...

127
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:44,250
Continue.

128
00:09:48,910 --> 00:09:50,370
Someone opened fire.

129
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:52,820
But I'm not sure who they were shooting at.

130
00:09:53,510 --> 00:09:54,890
And someone was talking.

131
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,250
He kept saying

132
00:09:59,910 --> 00:10:01,820
Seioutsu, Rokkai.

133
00:10:05,030 --> 00:10:05,940
Seioutsu, Rokkai.

134
00:10:06,750 --> 00:10:07,980
Seioutsu, Rokkai?

135
00:10:10,390 --> 00:10:12,490
Seioutsu...

136
00:10:12,790 --> 00:10:13,820
Rokkai...

137
00:10:14,270 --> 00:10:15,490
What does it mean, Fifth Master?

138
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:17,180
I don't know.

139
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:18,770
But they

140
00:10:19,390 --> 00:10:20,580
probably weren't speaking Chinese.

141
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,820
When he said Rokkai,

142
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:25,890
a gate opened.

143
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,490
Then he brought me

144
00:10:27,670 --> 00:10:28,700
to a river.

145
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:29,700
No.

146
00:10:30,910 --> 00:10:31,580
It was not a river.

147
00:10:32,790 --> 00:10:33,650
It wasn't outside.

148
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,340
But I could hear the sound of water.

149
00:10:38,870 --> 00:10:39,980
Underground river.

150
00:10:42,150 --> 00:10:43,060
Fifth Master, you're right.

151
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:44,300
Hatoyama

152
00:10:44,790 --> 00:10:45,890
took the underground river.

153
00:10:46,790 --> 00:10:47,300
But

154
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,420
how did they get down?

155
00:10:50,270 --> 00:10:50,940
Could it be

156
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:53,700
they descended

157
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:54,850
from the stage?

158
00:10:58,030 --> 00:11:00,130
You said Rokkai.

159
00:11:00,630 --> 00:11:01,340
Say it again.

160
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:04,340
Seioutsu, Rokkai.

161
00:11:04,630 --> 00:11:05,370
Louder.

162
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:08,820
Seioutsu, Rokkai.

163
00:11:12,870 --> 00:11:13,850
Seioutsu, Rokkai.

164
00:11:14,630 --> 00:11:16,490
It's Qingwuzi, six times, in Japanese.

165
00:11:17,030 --> 00:11:18,420
Qingwuzi?

166
00:11:21,750 --> 00:11:22,460
I remember it now.

167
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,580
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama mentioned in his report

168
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,580
that he found the Otherworld Tower

169
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:26,420
when he was studying

170
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,650
Qingwuzi.

171
00:11:28,030 --> 00:11:29,490
Perhaps it's the stage layout?

172
00:11:30,790 --> 00:11:32,180
But we did it correctly thrice.

173
00:11:32,630 --> 00:11:34,490
Do we have to do it three more times?

174
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:35,820
Impossible.

175
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:37,340
You can only rearrange the stage

176
00:11:37,550 --> 00:11:38,700
three times.

177
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:39,850
There's no other way.

178
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,580
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama knows far more

179
00:11:42,910 --> 00:11:43,940
than what we do.

180
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:46,580
He probably learned that by studying Qingwuzi.

181
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:47,700
If that's the case,

182
00:11:48,270 --> 00:11:50,010
Qingwuzi might be the key

183
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:52,100
that leads us to the underground river.

184
00:11:52,790 --> 00:11:53,250
Tiezui.

185
00:11:53,790 --> 00:11:54,530
I'll put you in charge of this.

186
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:55,580
Find out everything.

187
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:56,820
Yes, Master Zhang.

188
00:11:59,000 --> 00:11:59,940
We'll head to Xie Jiu

189
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,610
and tell him

190
00:12:01,910 --> 00:12:02,580
what happened.

191
00:12:03,060 --> 00:12:05,460
[Otherworld Tower Map]

192
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:12,770
What we know for sure

193
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:15,010
is that beneath the stage of Madam Wang's Lecture

194
00:12:15,030 --> 00:12:15,770
is the entrance

195
00:12:16,270 --> 00:12:18,250
of the underground river.

196
00:12:18,250 --> 00:12:19,360
[Underground River]

197
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:20,940
And this underground river

198
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,010
is the passage

199
00:12:23,550 --> 00:12:25,220
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama used to enter the Xumi Realm.

200
00:12:26,910 --> 00:12:27,850
Let's lay down

201
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,100
the details of our plan.

202
00:12:29,870 --> 00:12:30,580
Master Zhang,

203
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:33,010
I don't mean to offend you,

204
00:12:34,030 --> 00:12:35,250
but before we make

205
00:12:35,270 --> 00:12:36,060
a plan,

206
00:12:36,510 --> 00:12:37,580
shouldn't we find out

207
00:12:37,670 --> 00:12:38,770
what is inside the Xumi Realm?

208
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:40,610
That way, we know what we're getting into.

209
00:12:41,030 --> 00:12:41,490
Go ahead.

210
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,460
If you remember,

211
00:12:44,870 --> 00:12:45,490
Ding Qiansui

212
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:46,980
was imprisoned

213
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:47,850
deep inside

214
00:12:48,150 --> 00:12:49,220
the secret cell under Master Zhang's residence.

215
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:51,130
How did

216
00:12:51,670 --> 00:12:53,610
Hatoyama pierce through his chest

217
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,820
and kill him

218
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:56,130
with his hand?

219
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:05,850
Also,

220
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:08,180
that Japanese soldier who went to get water.

221
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:10,700
No matter how many times we killed him,

222
00:13:11,150 --> 00:13:12,460
he always came back alive.

223
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:19,700
Moreover,

224
00:13:20,150 --> 00:13:21,490
Master Zhang, you killed

225
00:13:21,550 --> 00:13:22,340
a Zhainiangniang.

226
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:33,860
Judging from its serial number,

227
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:36,060
it's not the only one.

228
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,220
In the Xumi Realm,

229
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:39,890
there might

230
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:41,730
be more monsters like it.

231
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:44,730
Tiezui is right.

232
00:13:45,480 --> 00:13:46,420
Be it

233
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:48,100
killing someone remotely

234
00:13:48,510 --> 00:13:49,820
and bringing the dead back,

235
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:52,420
Hatoyama must have only mastered

236
00:13:52,870 --> 00:13:54,250
all these tricks upon entering

237
00:13:54,270 --> 00:13:54,980
the Xumi Realm.

238
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:56,820
Otherwise, he would have already killed you

239
00:13:57,270 --> 00:13:58,580
when you were in the Otherworld Tower.

240
00:13:58,910 --> 00:13:59,610
Yes.

241
00:14:00,030 --> 00:14:01,010
That's what I mean.

242
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:02,820
The Xumi Realm

243
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:04,340
is dangerous.

244
00:14:05,080 --> 00:14:05,890
And the Otherworld Tower

245
00:14:06,630 --> 00:14:08,580
is just the appetizer

246
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:11,220
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama left us

247
00:14:11,670 --> 00:14:12,770
to keep us intrigued.

248
00:14:13,150 --> 00:14:14,650
If it's just an appetizer,

249
00:14:15,550 --> 00:14:16,730
let's talk about the main dish.

250
00:14:17,790 --> 00:14:18,650
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

251
00:14:18,670 --> 00:14:20,370
knows our literature

252
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:22,180
and mystic arts very well.

253
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,610
If his study continues,

254
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:26,730
he will become a threat.

255
00:14:27,080 --> 00:14:29,220
We need to eliminate him as soon as possible.

256
00:14:29,550 --> 00:14:30,340
But Master Zhang,

257
00:14:31,030 --> 00:14:31,940
Hatoyama

258
00:14:32,270 --> 00:14:33,460
leads a troop that he has trained

259
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:34,300
for years.

260
00:14:35,150 --> 00:14:36,220
They are elite soldiers.

261
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:38,220
The Xumi Realm is dangerous.

262
00:14:38,670 --> 00:14:39,890
If you want to mobilize your men,

263
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:41,460
you need to send in at least

264
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:42,530
a company

265
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:43,460
to fight them.

266
00:14:43,870 --> 00:14:46,180
But Changsha is in a delicate

267
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:46,980
situation,

268
00:14:47,150 --> 00:14:48,850
and Huo Wenhai is watching you closely.

269
00:14:49,390 --> 00:14:51,060
If you mobilize your men now,

270
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:51,770
it might...

271
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:52,650
You're right.

272
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,770
A big number is a disadvantage,

273
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,730
and it might even draw attention.

274
00:14:57,440 --> 00:14:58,130
We

275
00:14:58,480 --> 00:14:59,730
must handle this matter swiftly.

276
00:15:01,750 --> 00:15:03,890
Like how?

277
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:06,850
I'll take Xiaoyu

278
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:09,770
and you

279
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:11,130
with me

280
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:12,340
to capture Hatoyama.

281
00:15:13,910 --> 00:15:14,530
Master Zhang,

282
00:15:15,030 --> 00:15:16,100
I'll stay out of this.

283
00:15:16,510 --> 00:15:17,010
You see,

284
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:18,610
you want to capture Hatoyama.

285
00:15:19,270 --> 00:15:20,340
My presence

286
00:15:20,390 --> 00:15:21,650
is a dead weight.

287
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:23,300
I shouldn't be there.

288
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:24,490
- I shouldn't be there. - Have I not

289
00:15:24,510 --> 00:15:25,650
made myself clear just now?

290
00:15:26,270 --> 00:15:28,180
Hatoyama is an expert in mystic arts.

291
00:15:28,630 --> 00:15:29,130
Among everyone here,

292
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:31,250
only you have knowledge of it.

293
00:15:31,670 --> 00:15:32,610
You must come with us.

294
00:15:34,670 --> 00:15:35,220
Master Zhang,

295
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:36,820
- I should... - Sit down.

296
00:15:42,790 --> 00:15:43,220
Master Zhang.

297
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:44,420
What about this?

298
