373
00:17:46,110 --> 00:17:47,290
No.

374
00:17:47,480 --> 00:17:47,860
You...

375
00:17:52,030 --> 00:17:52,700
Laogou.

376
00:17:52,790 --> 00:17:53,250
Laogou.

377
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:55,490
Master Zhang.

378
00:17:55,750 --> 00:17:56,140
This is...

