462
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:53,490
Three rights, three wrongs.

463
00:21:53,880 --> 00:21:54,620
Mix rights in wrongs.

464
00:21:55,030 --> 00:21:55,810
Mix wrongs in rights.

465
00:21:57,030 --> 00:21:58,010
We did

466
00:21:58,030 --> 00:21:58,900
