536
00:25:32,070 --> 00:25:33,530
This time, they went to the Xumi Realm

537
00:25:33,960 --> 00:25:35,420
to end things for good.

538
00:25:36,440 --> 00:25:37,810
I can't just stand around and do nothing.

539
00:25:39,110 --> 00:25:39,810
Besides,

540
00:25:41,030 --> 00:25:42,330
I also have some knowledge

541
00:25:43,110 --> 00:25:44,460
that might be important to them.

542
00:25:45,920 --> 00:25:47,620
So you don't think that Zhang Qishan

543
00:25:47,640 --> 00:25:48,730
