561
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:30,940
He has a good memory

562
00:26:31,310 --> 00:26:32,220
and can fight very well.

563
00:26:33,680 --> 00:26:34,220
Thank you.

564
00:26:36,400 --> 00:26:37,140
Thank you, Godfather.

565
00:26:39,300 --> 00:26:42,380
[Changsha Garrison Command]

566
00:26:47,310 --> 00:26:47,940
Officer Huo.

567
00:26:48,270 --> 00:26:48,900
